  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You keep your allies aware of your theories and hunches, allowing them to use this information to their advantage. As long as your allies can communicate with you, your allies can use your theories’ base ability and may spend notions from your theories to gain the benefits of your (theory) talent’s breakthroughs. (Even if they have their own theories, they cannot spend your notions on them.)</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/study#toc9\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
